Image 1 is an Apple News+ offline promo on a phone, not a tablet. It is light-themed and works as a promo/upsell rather than an offline error state. It is polished but off brief, so it is bad.

Image 2 is a generic flat offline screen. It has a stock illustration, a placeholder "App Name", is on mobile, and is light-themed. It sits far below the bar, so it is bad.

