Image 1 is a generic web dashboard: light theme, a sales map and rainbow-ish charts. It isn't clearly a government services page and sits below the bar, so it's good at best. Since it doesn't show government services, it's borderline bad, but it is still a usable web dashboard, so good.

Image 2 is a pastel finance concept dashboard on a gradient. It is off the brief's page, so bad.

