Image 1 shows three dark iOS phones with a now playing screen and a playlist. It is on the right page and platform, but it is a generic three-phone row on a blue gradient, so it lands below the bar: good.

Image 2 is a music player widget card, not a mobile now playing screen. It has no device frame and reads as a component or widget. It is close to the brief but off platform and page, so bad.

