Image 1 is a "giving tree" app on an iPhone, but the screen shown is a side navigation menu, not a donation page, so it is off page. It is also dated and generic.

Image 2 is a dark charity fundraising app with a $10,000 goal ring, $6,685.01 raised, a donations chart and top walkers. It is on page and dark with a hero number, but it is an older iOS 7-era multi-screen presentation, so it is usable but below the bar.

